# held/civil/horn: the herald's horn (art weapon 12), slung at the right hip on a cord (PROPS, P2b): a curved horn of pale
# horn (the cloth 3 ramp: bone and ivory) tapering from its brass-banded bell to the mouthpiece. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# It hangs at the hip anchor on the sheath channel like a scabbard (rest; lag a pixel behind the bob; sit on the seat;
# gone where a clip names `-`, and while a posture's horn is in hand: prop-horn); under armNear, so the swinging hand
# passes over it. The played horn is held/props/horn.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4
legend I metal2 0
legend J metal2 4
body man woman
role held horn
layer belt
anchor hip
keys sheath
z 30

view D key rest origin 7 2
|....QQ
|..QQTQ
|QQTSRQ
|NOSRQ.
|IIQQ..

view D key lag origin 7 1
|....QQ
|..QQTQ
|QQTSRQ
|NOSRQ.
|IIQQ..

